    "description": "Takamatsu Construction Group Co., Ltd. engages in the construction business in Japan. The company operates in Construction, Civil Engineering, and Real Estate Segments It is involved in designing and construction of various architectures such as condominiums for rental purpose, buildings, factories and condominiums for senior citizens with care services; renovation, repairs and building maintenance; administration of buildings and condominiums, as well as overall real estate business; high end exclusive furniture, design and construction of renovation of residential and commercial facilities. The company also offers design and construction of shrines, temples and religious facilities; repairs and refurbishment of national treasures and important cultural architecture; wooden detached housing business, wooden apartment business, and wooden land utilization business. In addition, it designs, constructs, and renovates business of condominiums, offices, and stores; manufacturing facilities, warehouses, hotels, data centers, remodeling, PFI-related projects; excavation, research, analysis and preservation of archaeological resources; harbor, marine and environment protection civil engineering, designing and construction of residential, cultural and business-related facilities. Further, the company offers reclamation, dredging, harbor and river civil engineering, maritime logistics; slope protection, ground improvement, blasting construction, cooling and fireproofing utilities; sales of fireproof materials; property development; and real estate and investment operations on single-family and multifamily residential properties. Takamatsu Construction Group Co., Ltd. was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan."
